{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星鄭爽2021年接連捲入「代孕棄養」及「逃稅」風波後，演藝事業一度停擺，幾乎消失在幕前。</p><p>淡出演藝圈期間，她曾一度透過社交平台發聲，但帳號之後又悄然消失，公開動態也愈來愈少。</p><p>豈料近日卻有影片更新，鄭爽戴着Cap帽口罩，竟現身台北寧夏夜市</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:21:52.204162+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:10:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:27.253387+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:27.253387+00:00","content_hash":"9fa924a178cf1feff873385225000456e394c7d4481f1c9e6ea0f2707f62a131","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}